{"version":1,"content":"<p>荷蘭數據保護局近日發出建議，呼籲消費者不要購買具備人工智能功能的攝像眼鏡。該機構警告稱，這類可聯網、可長時間開啓的設備不僅會侵犯周圍路人的私隱，還可能給佩戴者自身帶來安全風險。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587708.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T17:38:29.616186+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T17:12:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T17:31:41.633076+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T17:31:41.633076+00:00","content_hash":"6a6f7d2f7bb733fad244a828cc67ff4f277726787dc567209b9d55214570c32c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}